WEBVTT

00:09:58.863 --> 00:10:00.563
transactions are transparent,

00:10:00.597 --> 00:10:02.830
and the ecosystem is equitable.

00:10:02.863 --> 00:10:05.097
The metaverse is a place
where we will spend

00:10:05.130 --> 00:10:06.863
more and more of our lives.

00:10:06.897 --> 00:10:10.230
Who builds it, who owns it
and how it is built

00:10:10.263 --> 00:10:13.530
will determine what this world becomes.

00:10:13.563 --> 00:10:15.430
But just like the real world,

00:10:15.463 --> 00:10:17.463
the metaverse is very complex,

00:10:17.497 --> 00:10:20.297
and there are many problems
yet to be solved.

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:22.063
And that is where you come in.

00:10:22.097 --> 00:10:23.297
You are the future,

00:10:23.330 --> 00:10:24.763
a digital citizen

00:10:24.797 --> 00:10:29.497
whose responsibility it is
to be a good steward to the metaverse,

00:10:29.530 --> 00:10:35.197
making sure that it is diverse, equitable,
accessible and sustainable.